WEBVTT

00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:14.121
Are you so glad
of that magic horn now, boy?
你现在高兴吹了那号角吗？

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:19.502
Your kings and queens have failed us.
你的王和女王令我们失望

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:24.924
Your army's half dead. And those
that aren't will be soon enough.
你的军队半数战死
那些没死的很快也会死

00:00:26.383 --> 00:00:28.969
What do you want? Congratulations?
你要什么？恭喜吗？

00:00:30.387 --> 00:00:34.141
You want your uncle's blood.
So do we.
你要你叔叔的血 我们也是

00:00:35.392 --> 00:00:39.230
You want his throne?
We can get it for you.
你要他的王位？
我们可以帮你

00:00:56.539 --> 00:01:00.918
(Nikabrik) You tried
one ancient power. It failed.
你试过古老魔法 却失败了

00:01:01.001 --> 00:01:04.088
But there is a power greater still.
不过有一种更伟大的力量

00:01:04.171 --> 00:01:09.009
One that kept even Aslan at bay
for near a hundred years.
那让亚斯蓝百年来无法靠近

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:16.016
- (growling)
- (rumbling)

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:26.193
- Who's there?
- (rasping)
是谁？

00:01:26.277 --> 00:01:27.861
(voice) I am hunger.
我是饥饿

00:01:30.906 --> 00:01:33.033
I am thirst.
我是渴望

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:37.121
I can fast a hundred years...
我可以一百年不吃东西

00:01:38.247 --> 00:01:39.790
...and not die.
也死不了

00:01:39.873 --> 00:01:43.460
I can lie a hundred nights on the ice...
我可以躺在冰上一百个晚上

00:01:43.544 --> 00:01:46.005
...and not freeze.
也冻不死

00:01:46.088 --> 00:01:52.011
I can drink a river of blood
and not burst.
我可以喝下一条河的鲜血
也不会撑爆

00:01:52.845 --> 00:01:57.057
Show me... your enemies!
让我看看…你的敌人

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:02.313
What you hate, so will we.
你憎恨的 我们也恨

00:02:02.396 --> 00:02:05.107
No one hates better than us.
没有人比我们更会仇恨

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:13.324
And you can...
guarantee Miraz's death?
你可以…保证米拉兹的死亡？

00:02:14.366 --> 00:02:16.243
And more.
还有更多

00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:30.883
Let the circle be drawn.
让我开始画圆圈

00:02:30.966 --> 00:02:34.637
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:54.657 --> 00:02:57.576
(shouting in foreign language)

00:03:42.037 --> 00:03:43.288
(Caspian) Wait.
等等

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.544
This isn't what I wanted.
这不是我想要的

00:03:48.627 --> 00:03:50.587
(snarls)

00:03:50.671 --> 00:03:56.301
One drop of Adam's blood
and you free me.
一滴人类的血就能释放我

00:03:56.385 --> 00:03:58.637
Then I am yours, my king.
之后我就是你的了
我的国王

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.848
No!
不！

00:04:22.828 --> 00:04:24.163
(Peter) Stop!
住手！

00:04:39.595 --> 00:04:41.638
(howling)

00:04:41.722 --> 00:04:43.724
(grunts)

00:04:45.434 --> 00:04:46.560
(screaming)

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:02.951
(gasps)

00:05:05.329 --> 00:05:08.081
Come on! Come.
来吧 来

00:05:09.166 --> 00:05:10.626
Get away from him!
离他远一点

00:05:15.506 --> 00:05:17.508
Peter, dear.
彼得 亲爱的

00:05:17.591 --> 00:05:19.927
I've missed you.
我好想念你

00:05:21.804 --> 00:05:23.514
Come.
来

00:05:23.597 --> 00:05:25.933
Just one drop.
只要一滴

00:05:27.434 --> 00:05:30.896
You know you can't do this alone.
你知道你无法孤军奋斗

00:06:01.343 --> 00:06:04.763
I know. You had it sorted.
我知道 你能解决

